      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUN BINDI RUN (1) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a neck (19.02) behind Classic Edge at this track. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. One of the contenders. MICK'S OVER (3) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 29 from 60 starts. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last eight starts, the latest when second (19.05) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Well-placed to take this out. ASTON OUTLAY (8) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Alphonse (18.94) in a Grade 5. Can feature again. ASADO (7) is worth including.",
